          "blockType": "actant",
          "bold": "false",
          "italic": "false",
          "strikethrough": "false",
          "code": "false"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " isn't the kind of person you'd typically expect to work in a lab. In fact, if you didn't know him, you'd think he  spends his days herding cattle and his nights strumming his guitar by the campfire and sleeping under the stars. Nevertheless, he's a steadfast presence in the lab, and one would be foolish to mistake his lax stride and terse conversation for lack of intelligence.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
